/ debug.tag attaches Tags to the running goal's frame (%!call.Scope%), which lives for the goal's run — the tag step's own frames pop when the step ends — so a later step reads them there.
TestTagWritesPairsOntoCurrentCall
- debug.tag critical=true, owner=checkout
- assert %!call.Scope.Tags.critical% equals "true"
- assert %!call.Scope.Tags.owner% equals "checkout"
